message: "If you use or build on AI Kids Games, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Kids Games"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Free, open-source browser games for kids: kart racing, farming, tower defense, space
  adventures and more. No ads, no subscriptions, no tracking. Every game runs offline from a
  single HTML file, and the repo includes a starter template for building your own kid-safe game.
authors:
